ions Challenged. Record actual agent session identity and actual model, not requested role label; if model unknowable say unknown (coverage incomplete). Preserve your FULL native final response unchanged as native-response.md in your reviewer directory, and optionally structured review.json. Final message must include full native review text as well as paths. Do not silently omit limitations.",
